<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "SE\bakibaki.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>Did I mishear...?
{PLAYSND "SE\bakibaki.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That's right, I misheard.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There's no way <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> would say something like that to me...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\bakibaki.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\肉付き\春花首絞め1.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> is strangling me...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Ha ha... just how crazy have I gotten?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> would never do this.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Besides, this isn't the strength of someone who's been asleep for 2 years.<PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\bakibaki.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1"><TXSPS>"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... die... die... die..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<TXSPN>It's just the sleeping aid making me hear things.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's just the sleeping aid making me sleepy.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If my mind is fading, it's only because I'm sleepy. It has to be.<PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\bakibaki.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka's</STYLE> half-open eyes are now open all the way, bloodshot.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka's</STYLE> black irises quiver as they <STYLE ID="3" RUBY="にら">glare</STYLE> at me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Black irises...?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\怖い効果音.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\肉付き\春花首絞め2.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Only one of them is green?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What a bad dream to be having.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But... even in a dream, it's painful.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> to come to me in a dream like this...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Did she resent it after all, that she ended up with a body like this?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'm sorry... that I didn't notice...<PG>
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n111\r\n11\r\n255\r\n10000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
It's no good... I can't... stay conscious anymore.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'm starting to lose my sight too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But my hearing alone is still clear.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,111" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n111\r\n11\r\n255\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Listening to <STYLE ID="1">Haruka's</STYLE> curses, like a chanted nembutsu, my consciousness falls away completely.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The last thing I hear, just before even my hearing is taken, 
{PLAYSND "SE\sliding_wooden_door_C.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
is the sound of the room's door opening.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Has someone come?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<TXSPS>But... 
{PAUSE ""}
if <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> resents me... 
{PAUSE ""}
I don't... want to live anymore.
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
